HUDLink authors
===============

Hamza El Alaoui
    Got the bridge working in a car over wireless CarPlay, and wrote the USB
    installer, the launcher, the Save logs step, imperial units, the off
    switch, the diagnostic build, the build and test tools and the
    documentation. Cleaned up and restructured the bridge's code.

The projects HUDLink builds on are credited in NOTICE.md and in the Credits
section of README.md.
